Version: 1.0

RestoreWorkspace: No
SaveWorkspace: No
AlwaysSaveHistory: No

EnableCodeIndexing: Yes
UseSpacesForTab: Yes
NumSpacesForTab: 2
Encoding: UTF-8

RnwWeave: knitr
LaTeX: pdfLaTeX

# R lives in the conda env `edna` (~/micromamba/envs/edna). Point your IDE's R
# interpreter there, or launch from a shell after `micromamba activate edna`.
